{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝（Elevit Kids Lutein Gummy）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$130，約26%。</p>\n<h2>愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$369</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$369</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$499</td>\n<td>HK$499</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$499</td>\n<td>HK$499</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝，HKTVmall的同款網上標價為HK$369，較表列次低標價HK$499少HK$130。愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>若比較兩盒，屈臣氏當日列第二件半價，總額HK$748.5，優惠列至11月17日。頁首價差按單盒標價計算。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月17日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E6%84%9B%E6%A8%82%E7%B6%AD-%E6%84%9B%E6%A8%82%E7%B6%AD%C2%AE%E5%85%92%E7%AB%A5%E8%91%89%E9%BB%83%E7%B4%A0%E8%AD%B7%E7%9C%BC%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96/p/BP_824891\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/elevit-kids-lutein-gummy-32pcs/p/139261\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/%E5%8D%93%E7%87%81%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E7%99%BE%E8%B2%A8/s/B1861001/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%9C%BC%E6%99%B4%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7/%E6%84%9B%E6%A8%82%E7%B6%AD%E5%85%92%E7%AB%A5%E8%91%89%E9%BB%83%E7%B4%A0-32-%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/B1861001_S_ALW_4897010458251\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a></p>\n<p>香港商品資料列有葉黃素及玉米黃質。兩者是類胡蘿蔔素，美國國家眼科研究所指出它們在視網膜有重要作用。兒童選購時應按產品標籤及實際需要考慮。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://www.nei.nih.gov/eye-health-information/clinical-trials/age-related-eye-disease-studies-aredsareds2/aredsareds2-frequently-asked-questions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國國家眼科研究所：葉黃素與玉米黃質</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$499－HK$369）÷HK$499×100%計，約26%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484915845583900_3347633216afb3986ee248.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝格價：HKTVmall HK$369，單盒約平26%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484915845583900_3347633216afb3986ee248.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到愛樂維兒童葉黃素護眼軟糖32粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月17日網上報價，HKTVmall的單盒商品總額為HK$369。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>今次只比較32粒莓果味軟糖。商品標籤列明適用年齡與成分。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:13.837678+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":840,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T17:12:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:58:52.348554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:37.419964+00:00","content_hash":"73d7f11381e1a15561131be09aa062003070d49ee1f3f78a06b8206738e73e3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}